[[File:LocationAndorra.png|thumb|250px|Andora (Eiropā)]]
[[File:Flag of Andorra.svg|thumb|130px|Andoras karogs]]

===Etymology===
A [[borrowing]], via other European languages, probably originally from {{etyl|es|lv}} or {{etyl|ca|lv}} {{m|es|Andorra}}, a word of disputed origin. The most probable hypothesis is that it comes from {{etyl|eu|lv}} {{m|eu|andurrial||shrub-covered land}}, but it is also possible that the source is {{etyl|ar|lv}} {{m|ar|الدرا||the forest}} or {{cog|es|andar||to walk}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{lv-IPA|andoːɾa}}
{{audio|lv-riga-Andora.ogg|lang=lv}}

===Proper noun===
{{lv-proper noun|f|4th}}

# [[Andorra]] {{gloss|[[small]] [[country]] in [[Western Europe]], [[between]] [[France]] and [[Spain]], with [[Andorra la Vella]] as its [[capital]]}}
